8. `p < lexer->end` is false, skip while loop
9. `token->text.start--` -> now points to `"` (which is `lexer->end - 1`, within buffer)
10. `token->text.length = p - token->text.start = 1`
11. `token->type = NJS_TOKEN_UNTERMINATED_STRING`

This is fine. No overflow.

